@startuml Flight Cancellation Refund Flow

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam activityBorderColor #666666
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EEEEEE

participant "Refund\nProcessor" as RefundProcessor
participant "Flight Booking\nSystem" as FlightBookingSystem  
participant "Payment\nSystem" as PaymentSystem
participant "Notification\nService" as NotificationService
database "Database" as Database

title Flight Cancellation Refund Flow

== Cost Analysis ==
RefundProcessor -> FlightBookingSystem: Get Duffel Order Cost
FlightBookingSystem -> Database: Query Flight Booking
Database --> FlightBookingSystem: Return Booking Details
FlightBookingSystem --> RefundProcessor: Return Duffel Cost

RefundProcessor -> Database: Get Associated Offer Requests
Database --> RefundProcessor: Return Shopper Payments

== Payment Status Check ==
RefundProcessor -> PaymentSystem: Check Traveler Payment Status
PaymentSystem -> Database: Query Payment Records
Database --> PaymentSystem: Return Payment Details
PaymentSystem --> RefundProcessor: Return Payment Status

alt Traveler Was Charged
RefundProcessor -> RefundProcessor: Calculate Refund Amount
note right: Duffel Cost + Platform Fee
else Transfer to Traveler
RefundProcessor -> RefundProcessor: Calculate Chargeback Amount
note right: Based on Shopper Payments
end

== Refund Processing ==
RefundProcessor -> RefundProcessor: Determine Final Amount
note right: Consider platform fees,\nprocessing fees, etc.

RefundProcessor -> PaymentSystem: Process Refund/Charge
PaymentSystem --> RefundProcessor: Confirmation

== Notification ==
RefundProcessor -> NotificationService: Send Cancellation & Refund Notice
NotificationService -> Database: Get Traveler Contact Details
Database --> NotificationService: Return Contact Info
NotificationService -> NotificationService: Send Email Notification
note right: Include flight details,\ncancellation reason,\nand refund amount

@enduml
